Domain TalentManagement

    documentation "The TalentManagement domain defines a set of entities related to the recruitment, hiring, and management of staff, including applicant profiles, applications, open staff positions, recruitment events, staff attendance, and staff leave."

    domain entity ApplicantProfile
    domain entity Application
    domain entity ApplicationEvent
    domain entity OpenStaffPosition
    domain entity OpenStaffPositionEvent
    domain entity RecruitmentEventAttendance
    domain entity RecruitmentEvent
    domain entity Staff
    domain entity StaffAbsenceEvent
    domain entity StaffLeave
